  "body": "Auction: 34 Shortland Street, City on Wednesday 2 December 2026 at 10:00AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\n1/13 Speight Road is a wonderful 3-bedroom, 3-bathroom lock-and-leave property, only minutes' walk away from the beach and the many delights of Kohimarama. Chic and comfortable, with luxuries like underfloor heating, a sleek modern kitchen, and an internal lift, making the top floor easily accessible.\r\n\r\nThe downstairs open-plan living, dining, and kitchen open onto a private, north-facing, walled patio - ideal for entertaining. Two gas fireplaces keep the space warm through winter, and the laundry and bathroom round out the amenities on the lower level. \r\n\r\nUpstairs, three bedrooms  and 3 bathrooms (two of which are ensuites) offer very comfortable accommodations to residents or guests, and skylights create a bright, light and airy feel.\r\n\r\nThere is an internal-access double garage and plenty of storage throughout. The patio area is ideal for evenings at home, or walk a few minutes to enjoy beachfront dining and a stunning Rangitoto Island view\r\n\r\nThe home is close to cafes and eateries, a yacht club, sports clubs, and the popular Tamaki Drive coastal path, plus Selwyn College and Kohimarama School. \r\n\r\nDon’t delay contact us for full details\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
